{"kind":"stack","id":"stk-levers","title":"Levers, pulleys and gears: making work easier","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1f2937","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Lever"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A bar that turns around a fixed point, called a pivot. It helps you lift heavy things with less force."},{"type":"image","picto":"see-saw"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"A lever helps you lift a heavy stone. What does it let you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Use less force to lift it","why":"A lever lets a small force have a bigger effect.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Make the stone lighter","why":"A lever changes how force is used, not the weight of the stone.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Stop the stone from falling","why":"Levers do not hold things still; they help move them.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Where is the pivot on a lever?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"The fixed point the bar turns around","why":"The pivot is the fixed point the lever turns around.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"At the very end of the bar","why":"Pupils may confuse the pivot with the end where force is applied.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"In the middle of the load","why":"The load is the object being lifted, not the pivot.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"Pulley"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-e","content":"A wheel with a rope running over it. It changes the direction of a pull, or helps lift a load with less effort."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"A pulley has a rope over a wheel. Which job can it do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Change the direction of a pull","why":"A pulley changes the direction of the pull on the rope.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Make the rope longer","why":"A pulley does not change the length of the rope.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Heat the load up","why":"Pulleys do not change the temperature of anything.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You are building a ramp to move a heavy box. Do you use a lever or a pulley?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Use a lever","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Use a pulley","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You push one end of a long bar under the box. The box rises easily with little force. Well done!"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You tie a rope over a wheel and pull down. The box lifts, and pulling down is easier than lifting up."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Gears are wheels with teeth that fit together. What do gears let you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Change speed or force","why":"Gears change how fast something turns or how much force it gives.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Stop water from flowing","why":"Gears have no link to water or fluids.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Make things lighter in colour","why":"Gears do not change colour.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"A small force on a lever moves a heavy load. Which idea does this show?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"A smaller force can have a greater effect","why":"The lever multiplies the effect of a small force.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Heavy loads never move","why":"The load moves, so this is false.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Force is always the same everywhere","why":"Machines change how force acts, so this is false.","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the lesson on levers, pulleys and gears!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. Machines help us make small forces do big jobs."}],"actions":[]}}
